{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>When he is punished</b> — that the court punish him, and it is a transitive verb, like וענשו אותו (and they shall punish him). Or בענש by giving punishment, then the simpleton learns wisdom." "<b>And when the wise is instructed</b> — a transitive verb to another." "<b>He takes knowledge</b> — in his heart."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:58.404057440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}